  "code" : "public int smallestDivisor(int[] nums, int threshold) {\n    int low = 1, high = max(nums), ans = high;\n    while (low <= high) {\n        int mid = (low + high) / 2;\n        long sum = 0;\n        for (int x : nums) {\n            sum += (x + mid - 1) / mid;\n        }\n        if (sum <= threshold) {\n            ans = mid;\n            high = mid - 1;\n        } else {\n            low = mid + 1;\n        }\n    }\n    return ans;\n}",
